# Normalise to LF in the repository for every text file. Without this a Windows
# checkout can rewrite shell scripts and source files to CRLF, which breaks
# scripts, produces noisy diffs, and makes line-sensitive tooling disagree
# across platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
